Package: a5pyramid
Title: Level-of-Detail Pyramids of 'A5' Cells for Browser Rendering
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Hugh", "Graham", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "hugh@belian.earth"),
    person("belian.earth", role = "cph")
    )
Description: Builds level-of-detail pyramids of 'A5' discrete global grid
    cells <https://a5geo.org/>, as created by 'a5R', and writes them with
    the cells they summarise to one 'Parquet' file laid out for browsers.
    Each coarser level groups the cells by the coarse cell containing
    their centres and reduces each column by mean, sum, minimum, maximum,
    mode or a representative cell. Each level is split into tiles of
    nearby cells, one row group each, and the file's metadata indexes
    every tile's level and bounding box, so a web map can fetch only the
    tiles in view with HTTP range requests. The engine is written in
    'Rust' and runs in parallel.
